# Play test of Crater Lair (CIPlay crater_lair, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the getaway jetty west
# of the facade (deck 1.15 m, x -53..-42.6, z -2.2..3), the hidden panel on the facade at -42.85 -3.3, the garage door in
# the facade (z 0.9..7) over the walkway (z 0.5..3.25, 1 m) and the dock pool; the hangar floor (1 m) x -42..-34.4; the
# control wing's doorway in its west wall (x -34.4, z -0.65..2.35), the control room west of the partition (x -30.3),
# the office east of it; the pet pool behind the bars (x -34.45, z -11.8..-2.5; the gap at its north end), the crater's
# dish on the cone's top at -3 -3.
island Crater Lair
offset 0.5101 0.0433
expect step 0
expect title Storm Engine
wait 5

# Tied up at the jetty: the getaway locker refuses; the hidden panel lifts the hangar door; in along the walkway
walk -52 0.5 to -48 0.5 to -44.2 -1.6 h=1.15
# (the hangar's rats first, as a player fights them: they bit the test player to death while it stood still over them
# on the hangar's roof - where 'use' and 'open' put it, 2026-10-04)
# (the quest's third step: remembered, and counted the moment the memo is read)
kill Tangaroa rat
open Getaway boat locker
expect message same red light
use doorpanel
expect message a hangar door
wait 5
walk -44.2 -1.6 to -44.2 1.9 to -41.5 1.9 to -38.5 1.5 to -37.5 -0.6 h=1.0
zone hangar
expect step 1

# The engineer's memo on its board by the wall, the seaplane's cockpit box, the hangar crate
read Chief engineer's memo
expect step 3
walk -37.5 -0.6 to -41.2 -1.2 h=1.0 below=7
reach Seaplane's cockpit box
open Seaplane's cockpit box
open Hangar crate

# Into the control wing: the safe's card reader and the incinerator refuse; the staff locker
walk -41.2 -1.2 to -37.5 0.85 to -35.3 0.85 to -32.6 0.85 h=1.15 below=7
open Chief's office safe
expect message card reader blinks red
use furnace
expect message door hanging open
open Staff locker

# The pet's pool behind the bars: the angler comes up; the keycard's box at the bottom
walk -32.6 0.85 to -35.3 0.85 to -35.1 -1.6 h=1.0 below=7
zone petpool
kill Angler fish
expect step 4
open Box in the pet's pool
expect story keycard 1
expect step 4

# The safe opens to the keycard: the launch codes; the incinerator - the dish dies, the alarm, forty-five seconds
walk -35.1 -1.6 to -35.3 0.85 to -32.6 0.85 to -29.6 3.4 h=1.15 below=7
open Chief's office safe
expect story codes 1
expect step 5
use furnace
expect message codes curl
expect story codes 0
expect shown alarm
expect hidden dishlights

# Out before the blast door seals: back through the hangar and the door to the jetty
walk -31.6 0.85 to -35.3 0.85 to -38.5 1.5 to -41.5 1.9 to -44.2 1.9 to -48 0.5 h=1.15 below=7
zone dock
expect step 6
open Getaway boat locker
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineTool 1
expect done

# The escape hatch drops a player from the control room to the jetty; the barrel by the jetty
# The roof laser: the beam runs north past the mirror; a quarter turn sends it east onto the panel, which shows the roof
# safe (the beam logged before and after)
expect hidden lairvault
beam lairemitter
use lairmirror
wait 2
beam lairemitter
expect message drinks the beam
expect shown lairvault
use escapehatch
expect message surface beside the Chief's getaway boat
open Barrel by the jetty
